#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:729
msgid ""
"Histogram Tool Dialog <quote><guilabel>Graphs &amp; Options "
"Tab</guilabel></quote>"
msgstr ""
"Histogramverktygets dialogruta – fliken <quote><guilabel>Diagram och "
"alternativ</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:731
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"graphs.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image "
"of the dialog to generate various histograms open to the \"Graphs &amp; "
"Options\" tab.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-"
"graphs.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Bild av "
"histogramdialogrutan med fliken Diagram och alternativ öppen.</phrase> "
"</textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:744
msgid ""
"The options in the graphs and options tab specify any graph to be created "
"and modify the appearance of the histogram:"
msgstr ""
"På fliken Diagram och alternativ väljer du om ett diagram ska skapas och hur"
" histogrammet ska se ut:"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:749
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>No chart</guibutton></quote> option causes the chart "
"to be omitted."
msgstr ""
"Med alternativet <quote><guibutton>Inget diagram</guibutton></quote> skapas "
"inget diagram."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:753
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Bar chart</guibutton></quote> option causes a bar "
"chart to be added to the histogram. For each bin, the bar chart shows a "
"horizontal bar indicating the frequency."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guibutton>Stapeldiagram</guibutton></quote> lägger till"
" ett stapeldiagram i histogrammet. För varje klass visar en vågrät stapel "
"frekvensen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:756
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Column chart</guibutton></quote> option causes a "
"column chart to be added to the histogram. For each bin, the column chart "
"shows a vertical bar indicating the frequency."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guibutton>Kolumndiagram</guibutton></quote> lägger till"
" ett kolumndiagram i histogrammet. För varje klass visar en lodrät stapel "
"frekvensen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:759
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Histogram chart</guibutton></quote> option causes a "
"histogram chart to be added to the histogram. For each bin, the histogram "
"chart shows a vertical bar indicating the density (that is the frequency "
"divided by the width of the bin)."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guibutton>Histogramdiagram</guibutton></quote> lägger "
"till ett histogramdiagram. För varje klass visar en lodrät stapel tätheten, "
"det vill säga frekvensen dividerad med klassens bredd."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:765
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Percentages</guibutton></quote> option causes the "
"frequencies to be expressed as percentages."
msgstr ""
"Med alternativet <quote><guibutton>Procent</guibutton></quote> visas "
"frekvenserna i procent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:770
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Cumulative answers</guibutton></quote> option causes a"
" cumulative frequency table (either with counts or with pecentages) to be "
"created."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guibutton>Kumulativa frekvenser</guibutton></quote> "
"skapar en tabell med kumulativa frekvenser, antingen som antal eller "
"procent."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:775
msgid ""
"The <quote><guibutton>Count numbers only</guibutton></quote> option "
"determines whether only numbers are counted. If also non-numbers are counted"
" they are first converted into numbers, usually into 0."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet <quote><guibutton>Räkna endast tal</guibutton></quote> avgör om"
" bara tal ska räknas. Om även andra värden räknas omvandlas de först till "
"tal, vanligtvis till 0."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:784 C/gnumeric.xml:2212
msgid "The <quote><guilabel>Output</guilabel></quote> Tab"
msgstr "Fliken <quote><guilabel>Utdata</guilabel></quote>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:786 C/gnumeric.xml:2214
msgid ""
"The Output tab contains the standard output options and fields described in "
"<xref linkend=\"sect-stat-analysis-overview\"/>."
msgstr ""
"Fliken Utdata innehåller de vanliga alternativen och fälten för utdata som "
"beskrivs i <xref linkend=\"sect-stat-analysis-overview\"/>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:795
msgid "A Histogram Example"
msgstr "Exempel på histogram"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:800
msgid ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex1.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>An image of some "
"example data for use with the histogram tool.</phrase> </textobject>"
msgstr ""
"<imageobject> <imagedata fileref=\"figures/analysistools-histogram-ex1.png\""
" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> <textobject> <phrase>Exempeldata för "
"histogramverktyget.</phrase> </textobject>"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:814
msgid "Using the Histogram Tool"
msgstr "Använda histogramverktyget"

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:816
msgid ""
"For example, you want to calculate a histogram for the number of successes "
"in several sequences of trials. The numbers of successes are recorded in "
"column A and the cutoffs of interest in column C (see <xref "
"linkend=\"histogram-example-1\"/>)."
msgstr ""
"Anta att du vill beräkna ett histogram över antalet lyckade utfall i flera "
"försöksserier. Antalet lyckade utfall finns i kolumn A och de önskade "
"gränsvärdena i kolumn C (se <xref linkend=\"histogram-example-1\"/>)."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:825
msgid ""
"Enter A1:A31 in the <quote><guilabel>Input Range:</guilabel></quote> entry "
"of the <quote><guilabel>Input</guilabel></quote> tab by typing this directly"
" into the entry or clicking in the entry field and then selecting that range"
" on the sheet. In the latter case the entry may also contain the sheet name."
msgstr ""
"Ange A1:A31 i fältet <quote><guilabel>Indataområde:</guilabel></quote> på "
"fliken <quote><guilabel>Indata</guilabel></quote>. Skriv in området direkt "
"eller klicka i fältet och markera området i bladet. I det senare fallet kan "
"fältet även innehålla bladets namn."
